msgid "Bitwarden uses the Accessibility Service to search for login fields in apps and websites, then establish the appropriate field IDs for entering a username &amp; password when a match for the app or site is found. We do not store any of the information presented to us by the service, nor do we make any attempt to control any on-screen elements beyond text entry of credentials."
